      "description": "<p>Mike DeWine, outgoing governor, says it was ‘wrong’ for campaign to have run ad featuring estranged mother of Ramaswamy’s Democratic opponent</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/feb/17/sign-up-for-the-breaking-news-us-email-to-get-newsletter-alerts-direct-to-your-inbox?utm_medium=ACQUISITIONS_STANDFIRST&amp;utm_campaign=BN22326&amp;utm_content=signup&amp;utm_term=standfirst&amp;utm_source=GUARDIAN_WEB\">Sign up for the Breaking News US email</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/21/immigration-ice-mass-deportation-trump-midterm-elections\">How will Trump’s mass deportation agenda shape the US midterm elections? Our reporters answer your questions</a></p></li></ul><p><em>Reporting from Anchorage, Alaska</em></p><p><strong>Mary Peltola’s campaign to represent Alaska in the US Senate has taken her to parts of the massive state’s interior that are inaccessible by road and on the frontlines of the cost-of-living crisis she hopes will make her the first Democrat to win the seat in nearly two decades.</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/oct/22/vivek-ramaswamy-ohio-trump-vance-us-midterm-elections-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
